Error: Cannot find port state LMU2_ON, either because no port state by this name was defined, or power state was not propagated from supply set to its functional net(s) or state is not uniquely defined on netgroup. (UPF-035)
# Legal State 2: ALL LMUS ASLEEP (Standby / Parked)
add_pst_state STANDBY -pst bms_global_pst -state {VDD_NOM GND LMU0_OFF LMU1_OFF LMU2_OFF}
Error: Cannot find port state LMU0_OFF, either because no port state by this name was defined, or power state was not propagated from supply set to its functional net(s) or state is not uniquely defined on netgroup. (UPF-035)
